# When Johnny Comes Marching Home: Patrick S. Gilmore (1863), his original four verses. Count 6/8 as two
# marching beats: "1 2 3 4 5 6".
{title: When Johnny Comes Marching Home}
{composer: Patrick S. Gilmore}
{key: Am}
{tempo: 132}
{time: 6/8}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - - D - -}

{start_of_grid label="Verse"}
| Am . | Am . |
